## Win thesis (shared value)

**CDC / U.S.:** Stop threats closer to source (Safer · Stronger · More Prosperous).  
**Uganda / MoH:** Last-mile signals into NISS/NAPHS II; trained CHWs; 7-1-7 practice.  
**FairBanks:** Local partner with live clinic, Community Reach, and FCHIP that feeds government — not a parallel silo.  
**Communities:** Earlier alerts and clearer referral paths.

